  "text": "D2JSR - Free maphack & cheat for Dota 2 Download D2JSR\n\n4.5 Total marks amount: 168\n\nFree version of the paid mod and skinchanger for Dota2 D2JSR (D2JS Reload). Allows you to familiarize yourself with the functionality of the mod before deciding to use the premium version! Ideal for users who want to test features without commitment and explore the capabilities of the mod first-hand. D2JSR\n\nAuthor D2JSR Release date 21 April 2024 Working & Up To Date since 15 May 2026 Downloads 48 305 Launches 168 053 Other information On the mod card in the ExLoader app\n\nLaunch guide/advices In mod' launcher near the 'Start' button you MUST select the 'Free version' of the mod and also change region to that one that is the most close to you (Or to anyone that works for you). Once mod is launched wait for blue '[PanoramaScript] ok' string in opened console, as soon as you see it - console can be closed and mod can be opened with keybutton.\n\nIf game is not launched after you click the start button and loader freezes for a few seconds and then crashes - the problem is your antivirus that blocks download of mod' library and it's injection! Popular functions in this mod Wallhack, ESP, WH - highlights enemies through walls Skinchanger - changes your skins and models InventoryChanger - adds skins to your inventory Can i install configs and LUAs and where do i put them? Configs installation path: Game folder . To install pre-made configs and lua scripts for modification, you can click on the gear button, which it is located near the modification's launch button. Download CFG",
